    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"struggle\" you're talking about... that's the problem. it's not just a moment, it's every single second of every single day. even when i'm sleeping, i'm exhausted. i feel like i'm just performing a role. i don't want to \"navigate\" through it, i just want the noise to stop. i want everything to just be quiet for once.",
